"Open SpaceMonger and pick what to scan:\n\n• Choose a disk from the list, or click “Scan a Folder…” to pick any folder.\n• Recently scanned places appear under “Recent” for one-click rescanning.\n\nEach disk shows how much space is used and free, and its file system." = "打開 SpaceMonger，選擇要掃描的內容：\n\n• 從列表中選擇一個磁碟，或按一下「掃描檔案夾…」選擇任一檔案夾。\n• 最近掃描過的位置會顯示在「最近」下，可一鍵重新掃描。\n\n每個磁碟都會顯示已用與可用空間，以及其檔案系統。";
"Scanning runs in the background and shows live progress. Press Cancel any time.\n\nSizes are the space items actually take on disk, like the Finder. Symbolic links aren’t followed and other mounted volumes aren’t crossed, so totals stay accurate.\n\nUse the refresh button to rescan." = "掃描在背景執行並即時顯示進度。可隨時按「取消」。\n\n大小是項目在磁碟上實際佔用的空間，與 Finder 一致。不跟隨符號連結，也不跨越其他已掛載的儲存裝置，因此總計保持準確。\n\n使用重新整理按鈕再次掃描。";
"The map shows where your space goes. Each item’s size is proportional to its share of the disk.\n\n• Sunburst: rings radiate from the focused folder outward into subfolders.\n• Treemap: nested rectangles. Switch layouts from the toolbar.\n\nHover an item to highlight it and see its size in the centre. Use the colour menu to colour By Folder, By File Type or By Depth." = "圖表顯示空間的去向。每個項目的大小與其在磁碟中的占比成正比。\n\n• 旭日圖：從聚焦的檔案夾向外輻射到子檔案夾的環。\n• 矩形樹狀圖：巢狀矩形。可在工具列切換佈局。\n\n將指標停在項目上以突顯並在中心查看其大小。使用顏色選單：依檔案夾、依檔案類型或依深度。";
"• Double-click an item (or a row in the list) to zoom into a folder.\n• Click the centre of the sunburst — or double-click empty space in the treemap — to go up one level.\n• Use the breadcrumb at the top to jump to any level." = "• 按兩下某個項目（或列表中的一列）以進入檔案夾。\n• 按一下旭日圖中心——或按兩下矩形樹狀圖中的空白處——可上移一層。\n• 使用頂部的路徑列跳到任一層級。";
"Click an item to select it. The panel on the right shows its size, share of the folder and of the whole disk, item count and path.\n\nThe list below ranks the current folder by size; type in the Filter field to narrow it.\n\nActions (panel, context menu or menu bar): Quick Look (Space or ⌘Y), Open, Open With, Reveal in Finder, Copy Path." = "按一下某個項目以選取它。右側面板顯示其大小、占該檔案夾與整個磁碟的比例、項目數量與路徑。\n\n下方列表依大小排序目前檔案夾；在「過濾」欄中輸入以縮小範圍。\n\n動作（面板、快捷選單或選單列）：快速查看（空白鍵或 ⌘Y）、打開、打開方式、在 Finder 中顯示、拷貝路徑。";
"Gather things you might delete in the Collector, then remove them together:\n\n• Drag items onto the Collector, or use “Add to Collector”.\n• Press “Move to Trash” to delete everything in it at once.\n\nDeletions always go to the Trash, so you can recover them. Safety stoppers refuse to delete system-critical files and whole volumes." = "在收集箱中收集可能要刪除的內容，然後一起移除：\n\n• 將項目拖到收集箱，或使用「加入收集箱」。\n• 按「移到垃圾桶」以一次刪除其中全部內容。\n\n刪除的項目一律進入垃圾桶，因此可以復原。安全限制會拒絕刪除系統關鍵檔案與整個儲存裝置。";
"“System & hidden space” is disk usage that couldn’t be attributed to readable files.\n\n• Grant Full Disk Access (the banner links to Settings) so system folders can be read.\n• Or use Rescan as Administrator to measure root-only files.\n• Open “Manage snapshots & purgeable space” to delete local Time Machine snapshots and reclaim purgeable space." = "「系統與隱藏空間」是無法歸屬到可讀檔案的磁碟用量。\n\n• 授予「完整磁碟取用權」（橫幅會連到設定），以便讀取系統檔案夾。\n• 或使用「以管理者身分重新掃描」來測量僅 root 可讀的檔案。\n• 打開「管理快照與可清除空間」以刪除本機時光機快照並回收可清除空間。";
"Focus highlights just the files you care about. Open the focus button in the toolbar and filter by name, type or minimum size; matching files stay bright while the rest dim and the list narrows.\n\nExclusions (Settings, ⌘,) skip items by name pattern while scanning, e.g. node_modules or *.log." = "聚焦只會突顯你在意的檔案。打開工具列中的聚焦按鈕，依名稱、類型或最小大小過濾；符合的檔案保持明亮，其餘變暗，列表隨之縮小。\n\n排除項（設定，⌘,）在掃描時依名稱樣式略過項目，例如 node_modules 或 *.log。";
"• Save Scan… (⌘S) writes the current scan to a .smscan file.\n• Open Scan… (⇧⌘O) re-opens it; .gpscan files can also be imported.\n• Compare with Saved Scan… diffs the current scan against a saved one and lists what grew, shrank, was added or removed." = "• 儲存掃描…（⌘S）將目前掃描寫入 .smscan 檔案。\n• 打開掃描…（⇧⌘O）重新打開它；也可匯入 .gpscan 檔案。\n• 與已儲存的掃描比較…將目前掃描與已儲存的比對，列出增大、減少、新增或移除的內容。";
"⌘O Scan a folder · ⌘R Rescan · ⌥⌘R Rescan as administrator\n⌘S Save scan · ⇧⌘O Open scan\nSpace or ⌘Y Quick Look · ⇧⌘R Reveal · ⇧⌘C Copy path\n⌘D Add to Collector · ⌘⌫ Move to Trash · ⌘, Settings" = "⌘O 掃描檔案夾 · ⌘R 重新掃描 · ⌥⌘R 以管理者身分重新掃描\n⌘S 儲存掃描 · ⇧⌘O 打開掃描\n空白鍵或 ⌘Y 快速查看 · ⇧⌘R 顯示 · ⇧⌘C 拷貝路徑\n⌘D 加入收集箱 · ⌘⌫ 移到垃圾桶 · ⌘, 設定";
